Laboratorios interactivos / Interactive laboratories

Español e inglés disponibles con el selector de idioma de cada laboratorio.
Spanish and English are available through each laboratory's language selector.

Orden sugerido / Suggested order:
1. PromptLab: promptlab/index.html
2. ClassifierLab: classifierlab/index.html
3. RegressionLab: regressionlab/index.html
4. GeometricLab: mlgeometriclab/index.html

Publicación / Published site:
https://gsi-upm.github.io/gisd-apau/1-intro/promptlab/
https://gsi-upm.github.io/gisd-apau/1-intro/classifierlab/
https://gsi-upm.github.io/gisd-apau/1-intro/regressionlab/
https://gsi-upm.github.io/gisd-apau/1-intro/mlgeometriclab/

No build is required. Keep language.js beside the four laboratory directories.
GitHub Pages publishes 1-intro through the existing pages.yml workflow.
Changing language preserves the current experiment and edited user text.
Classifier comparisons last until page reload. The simulations run locally;
PromptLab only contacts an LLM endpoint when the user selects and runs it.

Automated checks: ../tests/labs/README.md
